  "details": "Description\n\nWhen clicking a friends profile to join off them, location shows a missing picture and H5.. for descriptor.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nClick the profile of friend who is in an instance type which would normally be visible. Viewing friend under social tab will show them in the world, however viewing their profile directly will show the world details missing. Still however able to join off friend, seems to be visual only bug.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p3-1939-4803d92ede-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-20_17-01-57.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_d6b47f3a-14fd-42f8-92a9-f178d90490c2/1/file)",
